WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.139
A corporate event works when everyone knows
what needs to happen next.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.939
Our team brings years of production
experience

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.628
to your conference, launch, or client
event.

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:14.028
We coordinate the venue and vendors,

00:00:14.039 --> 00:00:17.183
set the cues for sound and presentations,

00:00:17.194 --> 00:00:21.361
and manage hospitality and staffing on the
day.

00:00:21.372 --> 00:00:25.583
Our event platform gives the crew one place
for the schedule,

00:00:25.594 --> 00:00:27.983
updates, and assignments.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:32.239
The platform can also handle guest
registration and check-in.

00:00:33.411 --> 00:00:35.700
Tell us what you want to accomplish.

00:00:35.711 --> 00:00:37.578
Let’s build the production around it.
